      "x": 974,
      "y": 242,
      "width": 592,
      "height": 168,
      "text": "boot:\n  build_engine + create_all_if_dev (env-gated)\n  hydrate runs from DB \u2192 invalidate stale non-terminal\n  attach session factory + token broker + jwks\n  refuse WEB_CONCURRENCY > 1\n  sweep stale 'streaming' chat turns\nshutdown: drain in-flight SSE \u2192 dispose engine",
      "originalText": "boot:\n  build_engine + create_all_if_dev (env-gated)\n  hydrate runs from DB \u2192 invalidate stale non-terminal\n  attach session factory + token broker + jwks\n  refuse WEB_CONCURRENCY > 1\n  sweep stale 'streaming' chat turns\nshutdown: drain in-flight SSE \u2192 dispose engine",
