      "y": 482,
      "width": 592,
      "height": 238,
      "text": "GET  /healthz   GET  /meetings\nPOST /runs                              \u2192 202 + run_id\nGET  /runs    GET  /runs/{id}\nPOST /runs/{id}/resume\nGET  /runs/{id}/files/{path}      \u2190 stories.json\nGET  /runs/{id}/stories/approvals\nPOST /runs/{id}/stories/approvals\nPOST /runs/{id}/chat                       SSE stream\nGET / DELETE  /runs/{id}/chat/history\nPOST /runs/{id}/chat/revisions/{v}/restore\nPOST /runs/{id}/chat/revisions/preview/{id}/accept",
      "originalText": "GET  /healthz   GET  /meetings\nPOST /runs                              \u2192 202 + run_id\nGET  /runs    GET  /runs/{id}\nPOST /runs/{id}/resume\nGET  /runs/{id}/files/{path}      \u2190 stories.json\nGET  /runs/{id}/stories/approvals\nPOST /runs/{id}/stories/approvals\nPOST /runs/{id}/chat                       SSE stream\nGET / DELETE  /runs/{id}/chat/history\nPOST /runs/{id}/chat/revisions/{v}/restore\nPOST /runs/{id}/chat/revisions/preview/{id}/accept",
