      "x": 1634,
      "y": 242,
      "width": 672,
      "height": 228,
      "text": "submit(meeting_id, user) \u2192 asyncio.Task\nhydrate_from_db (invalidates stale non-terminal)\ndrain_chat_streams(timeout) on shutdown\nchat_stream_started / chat_stream_finished\nwrite-through DB on every Run state mutation\nsafe_resolve: user-scoped + traversal guard\nsingle writer for _runs OrderedDict\nper-run asyncio.Lock for chat serialization",
      "originalText": "submit(meeting_id, user) \u2192 asyncio.Task\nhydrate_from_db (invalidates stale non-terminal)\ndrain_chat_streams(timeout) on shutdown\nchat_stream_started / chat_stream_finished\nwrite-through DB on every Run state mutation\nsafe_resolve: user-scoped + traversal guard\nsingle writer for _runs OrderedDict\nper-run asyncio.Lock for chat serialization",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
