      "y": 542,
      "width": 672,
      "height": 178,
      "text": "per-run asyncio.Lock (services/revisions.py)\nfcntl.flock around create_all_if_dev\nWEB_CONCURRENCY > 1 \u2192 boot refuses (RuntimeError)\nINSERT \u2026 on UNIQUE \u2192 retry-on-IntegrityError\nStreamingResponse.background \u2192 finalize on\n  cancel/disconnect (cancel-safe)",
      "originalText": "per-run asyncio.Lock (services/revisions.py)\nfcntl.flock around create_all_if_dev\nWEB_CONCURRENCY > 1 \u2192 boot refuses (RuntimeError)\nINSERT \u2026 on UNIQUE \u2192 retry-on-IntegrityError\nStreamingResponse.background \u2192 finalize on\n  cancel/disconnect (cancel-safe)",
